{"event_id": "evt_0020", "session": 1, "turn_no": 2, "world_time": "Sim, round 2", "actor": "gm", "kind": "gm_narration", "summary": "Narration for sbtest-003: Aero draws and disables the second remote with one blaster shot.", "visibility": "player", "knowledge_type": "fact", "known_to": [], "caused_by": ["evt_0017", "evt_0018", "evt_0019"], "roll_ids": [], "tags": [], "details": {"text": "The fresh remote hangs fifteen feet ahead of you at chest height, dead centre over the grey deck, emitter glowing that lazy orange. Nothing between you and it. Your indigo blade is still lit in your right hand, humming low, throwing violet light across the plates at your feet. No cover anywhere, the exit seam somewhere behind you.\n\nYour left hand drops to the pistol at your right hip, cross-draw, and comes up with it.\n\nOne shot. The bolt cracks across the fifteen feet in a red streak and takes the remote square in its housing. Blaster: 1d20+5, [8] + 5 = 13. Hit. Damage: 1d6+3, [5] + 3 = 8 energy.\n\nThe emitter flares white, then goes dark. The remote drops like a stone and hits the deck with a flat metal clang, rolls half a turn and stops, a thin curl of smoke rising from a scorched hole the width of a thumb. The ozone smell of the shot hangs in the still air. It never fired.\n\nThe room goes quiet except for the hum of your saber. *Round two complete.*\n"}, "idempotency_key": "sbtest-003:4"}
