 ["disabled"], "aliases": ["remote", "droid"]}], "notes": ["The remote lies dark and smoking on the deck, 15 ft ahead. No other threats are visible in the sim room.", "Your saber is still lit in your right hand; the blaster pistol is drawn in your left (one shot spent)."]}, "idempotency_key": "sbtest-003:ctx"}
